Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.90,Info-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\t(\fs85.545)\b1\fad(500,1000)\pos(960,935.644)}HBO原创连续剧\N衣柜字幕组翻译制作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:09.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而这就是您最担心的？\N{\fs50}And that's your biggest worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:13.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是的 任何一种病毒 但最担心的还是类似流感那种\N{\fs50}Yes, any kind of virus, but most probably something similar to influenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为会在空中传播\N{\fs50}Because of air travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:15.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,透过空气传播\N{\fs50}Through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 咳嗽——  - 不好意思\N{\fs50}-Coughing-- -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我指的是飞机上的乘客\N{\fs50}I meant people. On planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,您在您的书里提到过这个\N{\fs50}That was something you described in your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 比方说 马达加斯加出现新病毒\N{\fs50}Yes, a new virus in Madagascar, say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许几周内就会传播到芝加哥\N{\fs50}could be in Chicago within a matter of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最终结果就是全球性流行病  “全”意味着“所有人”\N{\fs50}And we end up with a global pandemic. Pan meaning "all."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:29.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全世界人口同时感染\N{\fs50}The whole world becomes sick all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:33.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,纽曼博士 您也是一位流行病学专家\N{\fs50}And, Dr. Neuman, you're also an epidemiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:36.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜流行性病毒传播的可能也会让您夜不能寐\N{\fs50}I presume the prospect of a viral pandemic keeps you up at night as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不会 - 不会？\N{\fs50}-No. -No?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不会 - 好吧 那今天的节目就结束了\N{\fs50}-No. -All right, well, that's our show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:43.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会 人类自古以来就跟病毒作斗争\N{\fs50}No, mankind has been at war with the virus from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:47.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有时候 如同战争一样 会有上百万人死去\N{\fs50}Sometimes, millions of people die, as in an actual war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但最后 我们总会胜利\N{\fs50}But in the end, we always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:52.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但您——我没理解错的话 您确实认为微生物会造成威胁\N{\fs50}But you-- just to be clear, you do think microorganisms pose a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:55.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,惨绝人寰的威胁\N{\fs50}In the most dire terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.62,0:00:57.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 细菌 - 不对\N{\fs50}-Bacteria. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 您喜欢说不 - 是\N{\fs50}-You like saying no. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:02.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是细菌 不是病毒\N{\fs50}Not bacteria. Not viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:03.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是？\N{\fs50}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:04.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌\N{\fs50}Fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:07.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 一般都是这样的反应\N{\fs50}Yes, that's the usual response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌看似无害\N{\fs50}Fungi seem harmless enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很多物种却深知其害\N{\fs50}Many species know otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:15.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为有些真菌的目的不是杀戮\N{\fs50}Because there are some fungi who seek not to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.23,0:01:16.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而是控制\N{\fs50}but to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我问问你 我们的LSD是哪来的？\N{\fs50}Let me ask you, where do we get LSD from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.72,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,LSD：麦角酸二乙酰胺，一种常见的致幻剂和精神兴奋剂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:21.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,您是从哪儿弄来的？\N{\fs50}Where do you get it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,提取自麦角 是一种真菌\N{\fs50}It comes from ergot, a fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.53,0:01:25.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,致幻蘑菇？也是真菌\N{\fs50}Psilocybin? Also a fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:29.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,病毒会让我们生病 真菌却能改变我们的思维\N{\fs50}Viruses can make us ill, but fungi can alter our very minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:31.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有种真菌能影响昆虫\N{\fs50}There's a fungus that infects insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:33.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比方说 它进到一只蚂蚁体内\N{\fs50}Gets inside an ant, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:37.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,通过循环系统传播至蚂蚁脑内\N{\fs50}travels through its circulatory system to the ant's brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:39.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并用致幻剂灌满蚂蚁的大脑\N{\fs50}and then floods it with hallucinogens,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.29,0:01:42.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就此使蚂蚁屈服于它的意志\N{\fs50}thus bending the ant's mind to its will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:44.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌开始主导这只蚂蚁的行为\N{\fs50}The fungus starts to direct the ant's behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:46.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告诉它要往哪走 该做什么\N{\fs50}telling it where to go, what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:48.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如同木偶师操纵傀儡\N{\fs50}like a puppeteer with a marionette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还不止如此\N{\fs50}And it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.97,0:01:51.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌需要食物来存活\N{\fs50}The fungus needs food to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以它开始从内部侵食它的宿主\N{\fs50}so it begins to devour its host from within,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用自身来代替蚂蚁的血肉\N{\fs50}replacing the ant's flesh with its own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但它不会任由宿主死去\N{\fs50}but it doesn't let its victim die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:04.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 它会防止这具傀儡腐化以确保其存活\N{\fs50}No, it keeps its puppet alive by preventing decomposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:07.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么做到的？我们的青霉素是哪来的？\N{\fs50}How? Where do we get penicillin from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:08.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌\N{\fs50}Fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:10.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,肖恩海斯博士 您好像有话要说\N{\fs50}Dr. Schoenheiss, you're in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这种真菌感染确实存在 但不会侵染人类\N{\fs50}Fungal infection of this kind is real, but not in humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:18.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 如果宿主体温高于34.4度\N{\fs50}True, fungi cannot survive if its host's internal temperature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么真菌是无法存活的\N{\fs50}is over 94 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:22.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,目前而言 真菌没有理由进化\N{\fs50}And currently, there are no reasons for fungi to evolve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:23.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来抵御更高的温度\N{\fs50}to be able to withstand higher temperatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果这点改变了呢？\N{\fs50}But what if that were to change?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:28.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果 打个比方\N{\fs50}What if, for instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个世界变暖了一点呢？\N{\fs50}the world were to get slightly warmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:34.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那现在 就有理由去进化了\N{\fs50}Well, now there is reason to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:38.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只要一个基因突变 子囊菌 念珠菌 麦角菌\N{\fs50}One gene mutates and an ascomycete, candida, ergot,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:41.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虫草菌 曲霉菌 其中任意一种便都可能\N{\fs50}cordyceps, aspergillus, any one of them could become
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:44.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有能力钻进我们的脑子里\N{\fs50}capable of burrowing into our brains
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:47.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,继而控制不止百万 而是上亿人\N{\fs50}and taking control not of millions of us, but billions of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:51.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,数十亿个思维被毒害的傀儡\N{\fs50}Billions of puppets with poisoned minds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:54.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,永久执着于同一个目标：\N{\fs50}permanently fixed on one unifying goal:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,将真菌传播至每一个活人身上\N{\fs50}to spread the infection to every last human alive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不惜一切手段\N{\fs50}by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:01.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且也不会有治疗手段\N{\fs50}And there are no treatments for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有预防药 没有特效药\N{\fs50}No preventatives, no cures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:06.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,统统不存在 连研发出来都不可能\N{\fs50}They don't exist. It's not even possible to make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要真发生了呢？\N{\fs50}So, if that happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会输\N{\fs50}We lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:18.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一会儿回来\N{\fs50}We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:26.31,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(601.6,440.4)}最后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:26.31,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(593.6,720.4)}生还
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:26.31,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(673.6,998.8)}者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:26.31,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(1425.6,717.2)}第一季
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:26.31,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(1480,995.6)}第一集
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:29.44,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(800,800)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\an7\pos(232,307.6)}{\fs64}当你迷失在黑暗中时\N{\fs32}When You're Lost in the Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了\N{\fs50}Alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:03.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了！\N{\fs50}Alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:08.27,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hbfbfbf\alpha&H19&\fs48\fad(500,500)\pos(950.4,1008.4)}翻译\N{\fs64}{\b1}叽拇啾＆疾火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:20.04,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H19&\fad(500,500)\fs48\pos(960,1011.6)\c&Hbfbfbf}精校＆后期＆监制\N{\fs64}{\b1}北落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:21.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,松饼粉呢？\N{\fs50}Where's the pancake mix?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 我该——\N{\fs50}Oh, was I--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是该我买的 抱歉\N{\fs50}Yeah, I was. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:26.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我本来要给你做生日松饼的\N{\fs50}I was gonna make you birthday pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:27.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这倒好\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我其实不喜欢松饼\N{\fs50}You know I don't really like pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢 是我想吃\N{\fs50}I know you don't like them. It was for my benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:37.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,补点维生素C\N{\fs50}Vitamin C.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你作业做完了？\N{\fs50}You get your homework done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,学到分数了？\N{\fs50}Fractions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是多老了？\N{\fs50}How old are you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:56.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,36了\N{\fs50}Thirty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:58.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很快就该穿尿布了\N{\fs50}Gonna have to wear diapers soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谁说我现在没穿？\N{\fs50}Who says I don't already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:04.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有蛋壳\N{\fs50}Shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,补点钙\N{\fs50}Calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:07.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fs50}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有给汤米叔叔留吃的吗？\N{\fs50}Is there enough for Uncle Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,本来该有的\N{\fs50}Well, there would've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:15.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还活着呢 老不死的\N{\fs50}You're still alive, you old fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:17.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呦 他多爱你啊\N{\fs50}Aw. He loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这叫依赖我 不是一码事\N{\fs50}He's dependent on me. Not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得是一码事 - 就是一码事\N{\fs50}-I think it's the same. -It's definitely the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:23.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还以为咱要吃松饼呢\N{\fs50}I thought we was havin' pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在路上给你找点吃的\N{\fs50}We'll pick you somethin' up on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:26.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弄混凝土的会来吗？\N{\fs50}Concrete guys gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说也许会来\N{\fs50}Yeah, they said maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许？不浇混凝土我们就没法定框架结构\N{\fs50}Maybe? We can't frame until we pour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不定框架结构我们就没有钱拿\N{\fs50}We're not gettin' paid until we frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:32.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱可以叫上别人\N{\fs50}Well, we could bring someone else on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 干起活来也快些 - 不 不\N{\fs50}-get the job done faster. -No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:35.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会把活儿分出去\N{\fs50}I'm not splittin' this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:36.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都不想分给你\N{\fs50}I barely wanna split it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以干两班\N{\fs50}We could work a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,认真的？非得在今天？\N{\fs50}Literally? Today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:40.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有数 九点前就能完工\N{\fs50}I know. I'd be done by nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,九点前 没问题吧？\N{\fs50}By nine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:43.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:46.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会带蛋糕回来\N{\fs50}I'll bring back a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:47.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fs50}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:52.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,……雅加达的暴动仍在持续\N{\fs50}...continued disturbances in Jakarta,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:54.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但建议美国公民……\N{\fs50}but are advising U.S. citizens...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,雅加达 那是在哪儿 中东吗？\N{\fs50}Jakarta. Where is that, Middle East?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:58.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没印象 肯定是个国家\N{\fs50}Doesn't ring a bell. It's definitely a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:06:59.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要么就是亚洲哪个地方？\N{\fs50}Or maybe part of Asia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:00.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,雅加达不是国家\N{\fs50}Jakarta isn't a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而亚洲的某个地方也可以是个国家\N{\fs50}Being a part of Asia isn't mutually exclusive with being a country,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:05.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,事实上 它是印度尼西亚的首都\N{\fs50}and in fact, it's the capital of Indonesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:07.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的 咱还有希望啊\N{\fs50}Shit. Hope for us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:15.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,赶紧解决 我们送你上学\N{\fs50}Finish up quick, we'll drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还在吃我的蛋壳呢\N{\fs50}I'm still eating my eggshells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还有七分钟\N{\fs50}You got seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的T恤穿反了\N{\fs50}Your t-shirt's inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:30.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他脑子短路了\N{\fs50}He's losin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:14.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉！\N{\fs50}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:21.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是邻居么！\N{\fs50}Hey, neighbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 你好\N{\fs50}Oh, Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:27.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,康妮刚问起你呢 你有一阵子没过来了\N{\fs50}Connie was askin' after you, since you haven't been over in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:29.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,逗他们开心\N{\fs50}Make 'em happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:34.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以放学后过来 但 也就能 待一会儿？\N{\fs50}I could come by after school, but just for, like, a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,能待一会儿是一会儿\N{\fs50}She'll take whatcha got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:38.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们可以一起烘焙 或者啥的\N{\fs50}Y'all can bake, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说到烘焙\N{\fs50}Speakin' of,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:41.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们这儿还剩了不少\N{\fs50}we got a lotta extra here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们要吃饼干吗？\N{\fs50}Y'all want some biscuits?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:45.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爸 你不是爱吃饼干么\N{\fs50}Dad, you love biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我确实喜欢\N{\fs50}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我正限碳水呢\N{\fs50}But I'm on Atkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:54.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,限什么？\N{\fs50}On what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是……我说\N{\fs50}It's, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们得走了 不过莎拉晚点会过去\N{\fs50}We gotta run, but Sarah'll be by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:08:59.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想让她待多久 她就待多久\N{\fs50}She'll stay as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟你们好好讲讲限碳水\N{\fs50}Tell ya all about Atkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊！我这就告诉康妮\N{\fs50}Great! I'll let Connie know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:05.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真行\N{\fs50}Solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:11.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听你们聊天可真他妈带劲\N{\fs50}Can't tell you how exciting it was listenin' to that fuckin' conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:13.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把烟掐了\N{\fs50}Put that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:15.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐啊\N{\fs50}Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.34,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz355.7\fscx110\fscy91\pos(1257.6,877.2)}{\fs64\c&4174a4\b1}沙漠风暴行动\N{\fs108}退伍军人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:25.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\b1\fscx103\fscy136\pos(1620.8,739.6)\c&Hf0f6f3}德州 奥斯汀市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:25.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fs54\b1\fscx87\fscy122\pos(1704,805.2)\c&Hf0f6f3}9月26日
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:29.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,照我的要求把图一模一样地画下来\N{\fs50}Want you to write this diagram out exactly as I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,始终是主语和谓语\N{\fs50}Always subject and predicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.60,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz344.4\fs84\c&H492b22\frx10\fry16\pos(1516.8,248.4)\b1}活出声色
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.60,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs84\c&H492b22\b1\frz343\pos(1459.2,542.8)}人生无限！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.60,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\frz346.5\frx6\fry8\pos(1372.8,736.4)\c&H627489\3c&H273145\4c&H273145}学不在学校\N而在人生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.60,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs84\c&H160563\frz350.1\pos(1083.2,922)\b1}记得微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,动词和名词\N{\fs50}Verb and noun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 句子是 “你要去哪儿？” 主语是你\N{\fs50}Okay, the sentence is, "Where are you going?" Subject is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:40.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是你要去\N{\fs50}You are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谓语\N{\fs50}Predicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:43.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪儿 是副词\N{\fs50}Where, adverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们明白了吗？好了 点头或摇头 让我看到\N{\fs50}You see it? Okay. Have some nods, shaking of heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我保证你们将来会用到这些的\N{\fs50}I swear you will use this later in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:49.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你们会坐在这里 相信我\N{\fs50}Believe me, that's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吗？所以……\N{\fs50}Okay? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是的 你们得弄明白这些！\N{\fs50}Yes, you need to know this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:01.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是的 你们下周测试会考到！\N{\fs50}Yes, it's on your test next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:05.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,作业要在明天下课前上交！\N{\fs50}Homework is due end of class tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.47,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hb2c9e1\b1\fs54\frz2.726\pos(979.2,586)\fscx86\fscy108\frx20\fry346}孤星钟表珠宝店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.47,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&87c5e0\b1\fs48\frx14\fry350\pos(940.8,690)}买·卖·修
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.34,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs54\c&H0e2a3c\3c&H6eb2d4\4c&H6eb2d4\pos(1281.6,562)\frz25.39}黎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.34,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs54\c&H0e2a3c\3c&H6eb2d4\4c&H6eb2d4\pos(1345.6,549.2)}巴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.34,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs54\c&H0e2a3c\3c&H6eb2d4\4c&H6eb2d4\frz336.4\pos(1408,566.8)}嫩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.34,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz314.4\pos(172.8,594)}五折
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,二十\N{\fs50}Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:02.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么便宜？\N{\fs50}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:04.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 那三十\N{\fs50}Okay, 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:06.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,二十就好\N{\fs50}Twenty's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,发条的事 我现在就修\N{\fs50}It's a spring. I'll do it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:30.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,吵一整天了 真的\N{\fs50}All day. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:34.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要关门了\N{\fs50}We're closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今天不营业了\N{\fs50}We're done for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:39.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,才3点15 我们7点才关门\N{\fs50}It's 3:15, we close at 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 他没法完工了\N{\fs50}I'm very sorry. He cannot finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:44.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经完工了\N{\fs50}I'm already finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你应该回家\N{\fs50}You should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:02.40,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hb2c9e1\b1\frz0.6695\fs54\pos(1259.2,589.2)}孤星钟表珠宝店
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:02.40,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&87c5e0\b1\frz0.6695\fs48\pos(1267.2,698)}买·卖·修
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你可来了 亲爱的 - 抱歉\N{\fs50}-There you are, sweetie. -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:13.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都要担心了\N{\fs50}I was gettin' worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚去给我爸取了点东西\N{\fs50}I was getting something for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:16.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗨 默西\N{\fs50}Hi, Mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:22.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 一切还好吗？我是指 新闻上说啥了吗？\N{\fs50}Hey, is everything okay? Like, on the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,新闻咋了 亲爱的？\N{\fs50}Like what, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也没有 只是今天路上有很多警察之类的\N{\fs50}Well, no, there was just a lot of police and stuff on the road today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,每天都是如此 不是吗？\N{\fs50}Well, that's true every day, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,外边那些人得让耶稣给他们正正心思\N{\fs50}People out there need to get right with Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:36.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,三颗钉子 一个十字架 正如四字神名\N{\fs50}Three nails, plus one cross, equals four-given.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:39.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉着咱可以做点曲奇饼\N{\fs50}I was thinkin' we'd make some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:40.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,巧克力碎的？\N{\fs50}Chocolate chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:42.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,提子干的\N{\fs50}Raisin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:53.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,尝尝嘛 妈妈 提子是绿色的\N{\fs50}C'mon, Mama. It's green.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:54.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可喜欢了\N{\fs50}You love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可算好了！\N{\fs50}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道我为什么要和她说话\N{\fs50}I don't know why I talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:01.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她已经聋透了\N{\fs50}She's completely deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:31.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,能过来帮把手吗？\N{\fs50}You wanna give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:32.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马上来！\N{\fs50}Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 阿德勒太太？\N{\fs50}Hey, Mrs. Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:58.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以借这个吗？\N{\fs50}Could I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:02.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fs50}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:04.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是丹尼的\N{\fs50}It's one of Danny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我爸很快就会回来了\N{\fs50}You know what? My dad's gonna be back real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 - 你确定吗？\N{\fs50}-I should go. -You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:11.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 那你得带上些曲奇\N{\fs50}-Yeah. -Well, you're takin' some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:03.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,市内暴力事件频发\N{\fs50}No comment today from the Austin Police Department
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:06.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人认为也许罪魁祸首是一种新的街头毒品\N{\fs50}regarding a rash of violent incidents across the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:09.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对此 奥斯汀警署今日未予置评\N{\fs50}some suggesting a new street drug may be to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们稍后继续 曼努埃拉·桑切斯在现场报导……\N{\fs50}More on that when we return, with Manuela Sanchez reporting live...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可算锁了一次门\N{\fs50}You locked the door for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:23.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fs50}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:25.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 10点了 - 我知道\N{\fs50}-It's 10. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:35.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们给错了露头砖的尺寸\N{\fs50}They gave us the wrong size for the headers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:39.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些对你来说毫无意义 不好意思\N{\fs50}That doesn't mean anything to ya. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,蛋糕呢？\N{\fs50}Where's the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:43.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行不行啊 老兄\N{\fs50}C'mon, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明天给咱们买一个\N{\fs50}I'll get us one tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:47.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,发誓 要么就不给你礼物了\N{\fs50}Swear, or you don't get your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:49.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你给我准备了礼物？\N{\fs50}You got me a present?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快发誓\N{\fs50}Swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:51.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以性命发誓\N{\fs50}On my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:00.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fs50}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:06.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给你修好了\N{\fs50}Fixed it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 有修好吗？ - 什么？\N{\fs50}-Did you? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我什么都听不到\N{\fs50}I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这招好差劲\N{\fs50}That was lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你好差劲 - 是啊 我知道\N{\fs50}-You're lame. -Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:23.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你哪来的修表钱？\N{\fs50}Where'd you get the money for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,贩毒 我贩超猛的毒\N{\fs50}Drugs. I sell hardcore drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比我干的活儿要强\N{\fs50}It's better than what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:29.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只花了20刀 我从你那儿偷的\N{\fs50}It was only $20, which I stole from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,本可以偷60刀的 但我把剩下的钱放回去了\N{\fs50}I could've stolen 60, but I put the change back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:34.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为我是个诚实的小偷\N{\fs50}because I'm an honest thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再说了 心意更重要\N{\fs50}Besides, it's the thought that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:38.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你自己永远都不会去修 所以\N{\fs50}And you were never gonna do it for yourself, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:44.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:48.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有一个礼物\N{\fs50}There's one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:52.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从阿德勒家借来的\N{\fs50}Borrowed it from the Adlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.10,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\frz352.8\c&H0d0e27\b1\3c&H233a50\4c&H233a50\pos(1083.2,754)\fscx101\fscy121}柯蒂斯和毒蛇2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.10,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0d0e27\b1\fs48\3c&H233a50\4c&H233a50\frz358.7\fscx104\fscy99\pos(1040,237.2)}这次是家事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:54.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,喔 这版还附带了删减片段\N{\fs50}Oh, this is the one with the deleted scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:55.27,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2a455e\fs40\frz356\pos(1020.8,341.2)\fscx101\fscy105}“我见过\N最好的\N表演之一”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:55.27,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2a455e\fs40\fscx101\fscy105\frz353.9\pos(993.6,595.6)}“全世界\N都在等\N的续集”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对啊 想想那些得有多烂\N{\fs50}Yeah, imagine how bad those have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:59.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快 放进去 趁着你的生日还没过\N{\fs50}C'mon, pop it in. While it's still your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:10.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可别睡着了\N{\fs50}Don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:10.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我当然不会\N{\fs50}'Course, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:12.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这片子太吸引人了\N{\fs50}It's too riveting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fs50}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 是我\N{\fs50}Joel, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:38.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fs50}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我进号子了\N{\fs50}But I'm in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:43.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈了个逼的\N{\fs50}Goddammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:44.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这次不是我的错\N{\fs50}Wasn't my fault this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我当时在酒吧里 有个人突然发了疯 朝着女服务员挥拳头\N{\fs50}I was at the bar, some guy goes crazy, starts swingin' at a waitress,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:49.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就上去了 把那人打晕 条子就来了——\N{\fs50}I stepped in, knocked him out, cops show up--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:50.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 这些都他妈无所谓\N{\fs50}Look, it doesn't fuckin' matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你得把我保出来\N{\fs50}You gotta bail me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在？\N{\fs50}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:55.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今天是周五 你今晚不把我弄出来 我就得待上一整个周末\N{\fs50}It's Friday, you don't get me out tonight, I'm in here all weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:57.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这地方他妈疯了 乔尔\N{\fs50}It's a fuckin' madhouse, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:59.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我得出去 - 哪个监狱？特拉维斯县的？\N{\fs50}-I gotta get out. -Well, which jail? Travis County?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:00.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 10号路上的\N{\fs50}Yeah, on 10th.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 汤米\N{\fs50}Goddammit, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:03.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:06.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fs50}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:08.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:11.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他娘的蠢货\N{\fs50}Fuckin' idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爸？\N{\fs50}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:24.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爸？！\N{\fs50}Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,……室内 执法与急救服务\N{\fs50}...indoors. Law enforcement and emergency services
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.92,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz0.7327\c&Hf0e2e0\b1\pos(979.2,864.4)}全国警报\N{\fs54}主要入境点系统\N发布\N紧急行动\N通知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:48.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就在当地并将联系提供进一步指示\N{\fs50}are in the area and will be in contact with further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,待在室内 执法与急救服务……\N{\fs50}Stay indoors, law enforcement...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:02.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乖 乖 默西\N{\fs50}Easy. Easy, Mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在外面干什么呢 小子？\N{\fs50}What're you doing out here, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:35.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来 我们回家\N{\fs50}C'mon, let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快来 默西 别闹了\N{\fs50}C'mon, Mercy. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:42.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,默西\N{\fs50}Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿德勒太太？\N{\fs50}Mrs. Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿德勒太太？\N{\fs50}Mrs. Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿德勒太太？\N{\fs50}Mrs. Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.81,0:22:03.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fs50}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:55.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,进车里！快点！\N{\fs50}Get in the truck! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:57.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上车！\N{\fs50}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:10.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 我们怎么办 ？\N{\fs50}What are we doin', Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:27.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你杀了她\N{\fs50}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:28.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我很抱歉\N{\fs50}Baby, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:29.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 我们得走了\N{\fs50}Joel, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:30.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉 听我说\N{\fs50}Sarah, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:32.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,病的不止是阿德勒一家\N{\fs50}It's not just the Adlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:35.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们要勇敢 我们要逃出去\N{\fs50}But we're gonna be brave, and we're gonna get outta this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:37.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 快走 来吧\N{\fs50}Hey. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.61,0:23:39.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fs50}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:42.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.95,0:23:44.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,丹妮丝 你快回屋子里！\N{\fs50}Denise, you get back inside the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:46.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你把门锁紧了！马上！！\N{\fs50}You lock your doors! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:47.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 进来！\N{\fs50}C'mon, c'mon, get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:58.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 系好安全带 - 抓稳了\N{\fs50}-Get your seat belt on. -Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:04.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 乔尔！\N{\fs50}Jesus Christ, Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.47,0:24:10.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你上7——  - 71号公路 我知道\N{\fs50}-You take 70-- -71, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:12.63,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs48\move(1216,456.4,1420,440)}←奥斯汀\N{\fs36}圣马科斯→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:12.63,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs48\move(1216,520,1378,540)}医院→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:12.63,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs36\move(784,405.2,689,329)}西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:12.63,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs36\move(857.6,400,782,327)}东
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.57,0:24:20.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸——  - 我们也不清楚\N{\fs50}-Daddy-- -We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.61,0:24:23.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说是病毒 某种寄生虫\N{\fs50}They're saying it's a virus. Some kind of parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是恐怖分子弄出来的吗？\N{\fs50}Is it from terrorists?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:27.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不清楚\N{\fs50}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.49,0:24:28.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们也病了吗？\N{\fs50}Are we sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.43,0:24:29.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没 当然没有\N{\fs50}No. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:31.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么有爆炸？\N{\fs50}Why did things blow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.08,0:24:33.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,手机没信号 也收不到广播\N{\fs50}No cellphone, no radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:34.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚才新闻还讲个不停\N{\fs50}Minute ago, newsman wouldn't shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.79,0:24:35.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fs50}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.82,0:24:36.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:38.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们没病？\N{\fs50}How do you know we're not sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.05,0:24:41.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说病的主要是城里的人\N{\fs50}They're saying it's mostly people in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.67,0:24:43.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以他们把高速路封锁了\N{\fs50}That's why they got the highway blocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:48.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs50}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:50.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是吉米家\N{\fs50}It's Jimmy's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.53,0:25:01.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿德勒家有时候会把奶奶带进城里\N{\fs50}The Adlers would take Nana into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.99,0:25:03.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去医院拿药之类的\N{\fs50}To the hospital for stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:06.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 他们确实 也许就是因为这个\N{\fs50}That's right. They would. That's probably why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.08,0:25:12.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是 你得去很多次才会得病 对吧？\N{\fs50}But, you'd have to go a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:14.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没事 相信我\N{\fs50}We're fine. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.21,0:25:19.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:26.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里！在这里！\N{\fs50}Here! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:28.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 你在干嘛？\N{\fs50}-Hey! -What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.30,0:25:30.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 有小孩 乔尔 - 我们也有 向前开\N{\fs50}-Got a kid, Joel. -So do we. Keep driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.97,0:25:33.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以让他们坐后边\N{\fs50}We could put them in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.35,0:25:38.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还会有别人来的\N{\fs50}Somebody else'll come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:51.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！所有人都他妈想一块儿去了\N{\fs50}Fuck! Everybody had the same fuckin' idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.58,0:25:53.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我开不过去\N{\fs50}I can't get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.54,0:25:55.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我们先想想 我们先想想\N{\fs50}All right. Let's think it through, we'll think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.37,0:25:56.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 操！ - 这样 我们走草地\N{\fs50}-Fuck! -All right, take the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:58.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,穿过去 然后从西边再上路\N{\fs50}We cut across and we pick up on the west side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.79,0:26:00.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行行行 西边 西边 好\N{\fs50}Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. West, west, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.59,0:26:01.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 坐稳\N{\fs50}All right, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.14,0:26:17.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！操他妈的军队\N{\fs50}Shit! Fuckin' army.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.52,0:26:18.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是好事吗？\N{\fs50}Isn't that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.67,0:26:19.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对他们来说好\N{\fs50}It's good for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.36,0:26:21.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但那儿是我们要上的高速\N{\fs50}but that's the highway we're tryin' to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 车别停 向北走\N{\fs50}All right, keep movin'. Head north.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:23.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能会有很多人\N{\fs50}Could be a lotta people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:24.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得 我们不能往南走\N{\fs50}Well, we can't go south,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.57,0:26:26.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不能去东边 不能去西边\N{\fs50}we can't go east, we can't go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:28.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们他妈还能去哪儿？\N{\fs50}Hell else we supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.95,0:26:29.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 走了！\N{\fs50}Tommy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.25,0:26:36.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.04,0:26:38.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 前边这地方我知道\N{\fs50}Yeah, I know that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.17,0:26:39.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 这么走可以 - 现在可以 之后呢？\N{\fs50}-This can work. -Yeah, but then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.54,0:26:42.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道 墨西哥吧 反正越远越好\N{\fs50}I don't know. Mexico. Just far, far as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.34,0:26:43.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还剩多少油？\N{\fs50}How much gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:45.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,四分之三缸\N{\fs50}Three-quarter tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.46,0:26:47.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,穿过镇子 河边有个高尔夫球场 直接穿过去\N{\fs50}Go through town, golf course by the river, straight across,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.05,0:26:49.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们从封锁区另一头上高速\N{\fs50}we pick up the highway on the other side of the blockade,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后就出去了\N{\fs50}then we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.35,0:27:01.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许到处都有\N{\fs50}Maybe it's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.98,0:27:05.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许根本无处可去\N{\fs50}Maybe there's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:12.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我了个操？！\N{\fs50}What the fuck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.92,0:27:27.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的 得绕过去\N{\fs50}Son of a bitch. Gotta go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.17,0:27:28.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,抓稳了！\N{\fs50}Grab somethin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.77,0:27:45.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 继续开 继续开\N{\fs50}All right, keep goin', keep goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.57,0:27:47.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操 汤米！\N{\fs50}Shit. Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.95,0:27:52.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 你不能停这儿\N{\fs50}Tommy, you can't stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.74,0:27:54.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我不能朝人开 - 你开玩笑吗？\N{\fs50}-I can't drive through 'em all. -Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.28,0:27:55.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只管往前开！\N{\fs50}Just keep goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.75,0:28:02.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 走 走 倒 倒 倒\N{\fs50}Go, go, go. Back, back, back,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:03.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,-倒 倒 倒 倒！ - 别催了！\N{\fs50}-back, back, back, back! -I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.67,0:28:10.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 开快点！我们得走！\N{\fs50}Tommy, go faster! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.13,0:28:11.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在开了！哪儿他妈都走不了！\N{\fs50}I'm tryin'! There's nowhere to fuckin' go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.43,0:28:12.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找个巷子！\N{\fs50}Find an alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:13.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪有巷子？哪里都是人！\N{\fs50}What alley? There's people everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:15.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,直接他妈的碾过去！我们得马上离开这条街！\N{\fs50}Roll the fuck over them! We gotta get off this street now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.97,0:28:17.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一直在这么做 乔尔\N{\fs50}That's what I'm tryin' to do, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:19.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会没事的 继续开就行\N{\fs50}We're gonna be okay. Just keep drivin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:20.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爸？\N{\fs50}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.27,0:28:22.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:25.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 走！\N{\fs50}Move. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.72,0:28:59.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉 莎拉\N{\fs50}Sarah, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:01.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,待在这儿 别动\N{\fs50}Stay right there. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.56,0:29:04.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 你没事吧？\N{\fs50}Tommy, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.23,0:29:05.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我没事\N{\fs50}Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.16,0:29:21.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉 不要看\N{\fs50}Sarah, don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.45,0:29:23.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看我就好 好吗？\N{\fs50}You look at me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:25.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 宝贝 我明白 我明白\N{\fs50}I'm sorry, baby, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.29,0:29:26.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过来 用手抱住我\N{\fs50}Come here. Put your arms around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:27.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fs50}Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:31.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有我在 有我在\N{\fs50}I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.42,0:29:32.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fs50}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.80,0:29:37.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？你还好吗？\N{\fs50}Are you okay? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.09,0:29:38.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我的脚踝 - 好 我知道了\N{\fs50}-My ankle. -All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:40.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这条街！妈的！\N{\fs50}We gotta get off the street! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.31,0:29:46.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米？！\N{\fs50}Tommy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.94,0:29:48.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米？\N{\fs50}Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.81,0:29:49.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米！\N{\fs50}Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.61,0:29:53.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,朝着河走！我会找到路的\N{\fs50}Head to the river! I'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:56.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带她出去 乔尔！快走！\N{\fs50}Get her outta here, Joel! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.78,0:29:58.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不能抛下他\N{\fs50}We can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.68,0:29:59.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fs50}He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.24,0:30:00.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跑得动吗？\N{\fs50}Can you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:00.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.12,0:30:03.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,眼睛盯住我\N{\fs50}You keep your eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.27,0:30:03.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:04.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.18,0:30:04.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.54,0:30:06.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别看其它地方\N{\fs50}And don't look anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.54,0:30:07.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:08.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 宝贝 你很安全\N{\fs50}It's okay, baby. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:10.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fs50}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:13.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我女儿受伤了 脚踝伤了\N{\fs50}My daughter's hurt. Her ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.00,0:31:14.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,停在原地！\N{\fs50}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.36,0:31:16.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.32,0:31:20.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别紧张 我们没生病！\N{\fs50}Easy now. We're not sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:22.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这儿有两个平民在河边 其中一个受伤了\N{\fs50}I got two civilians by the river, one of 'em injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.45,0:31:26.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,脚踝受伤\N{\fs50}Ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.50,0:31:28.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米叔叔怎么办？\N{\fs50}What about Uncle Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.37,0:31:30.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们先把你送到安全的地方\N{\fs50}We're gonna get you somewhere safe first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:31.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我们再回去找他 好吗？\N{\fs50}Then we'll go back for him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:32.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fs50}-Okay. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.63,0:31:34.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对不起 重复一遍？\N{\fs50}I'm sorry, repeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.42,0:31:36.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿！没说你可以动\N{\fs50}Hey! No one told you to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.67,0:31:38.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.55,0:31:41.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.64,0:31:45.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.31,0:31:51.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没生病\N{\fs50}We're not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.15,0:31:55.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fs50}Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.15,0:31:57.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没生病！\N{\fs50}we are not sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.83,0:32:11.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.29,0:32:14.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,请不要\N{\fs50}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.60,0:32:25.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs50}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.81,0:32:31.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 噢 不\N{\fs50}No. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.69,0:32:34.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fs50}No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.73,0:32:38.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事 你没事\N{\fs50}Okay, You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.15,0:32:39.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 把手移开 宝贝\N{\fs50}You're okay. Move your hand, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.03,0:32:41.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把手移开\N{\fs50}Move your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.74,0:32:49.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道 宝贝 我知道 我知道 我知道 我知道\N{\fs50}I know, baby, I know, I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.70,0:32:51.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道很疼\N{\fs50}I know it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:54.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 别往下看 往上看 往上看\N{\fs50}Alright. Don't look down, look up, look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.42,0:32:57.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 宝贝 你没事 你没事\N{\fs50}Come on, baby. You're okay, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.46,0:32:59.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 我知道 我知道 宝贝 我知道 我知道\N{\fs50}I know, I know, I know, I know, baby, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:01.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道这样很疼\N{\fs50}I know this hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.55,0:33:02.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fs50}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.88,0:33:06.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 宝贝 宝贝 宝贝 听我说\N{\fs50}All right, baby, baby, baby, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.55,0:33:10.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要把你抱起来 好吗？我要抱你起来\N{\fs50}I gotta get you up, okay? I gotta get you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.18,0:33:12.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吗？来吧\N{\fs50}All right? You come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.18,0:33:14.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧 我知道 宝贝\N{\fs50}You come on. I know, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.31,0:33:16.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不 我知道 我知道 我知道 我知道 我知道 我知道\N{\fs50}No, no. I know, I know, I know, I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.06,0:33:18.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 帮我！\N{\fs50}Tommy, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.40,0:33:20.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.53,0:33:22.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这样 宝贝女儿\N{\fs50}C'mon, baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:24.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这样 宝贝女儿 我得让你起来\N{\fs50}C'mon, baby girl, I gotta get you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.70,0:33:25.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.86,0:33:27.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来 我们起来\N{\fs50}Come on, we'll get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.16,0:33:28.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝女儿\N{\fs50}Come on, baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:32.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这样 别——求你了\N{\fs50}Come on, come-- Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.70,0:33:56.50,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\b1\fscx102\fscy128\fad(800,800)\pos(960,781.2)}二十年后
