Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.29,0:36:20.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这样你就不会跌下椅子了\N{\fs50}We don't want you falling out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.21,0:36:22.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fs50}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.54,0:36:25.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是一个人吗？\N{\fs50}Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.88,0:36:32.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fs50}And,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:36.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里是怎么弄的？\N{\fs50}how did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.52,0:36:42.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这儿会有一点点痒\N{\fs50}There's gonna be a little tickle right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:54.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听我说 给你吃完药之后\N{\fs50}What if I told you that after we gave you some medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.66,0:36:56.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就给你吃你最喜欢的食物\N{\fs50}we're gonna find you your favorite food to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.03,0:36:58.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\N{\fs50}Would you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.33,0:37:02.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我们给你找些新衣服……和玩具\N{\fs50}And then we'll get you some new clothes... and toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想玩多少有多少\N{\fs50}As many as you wanna play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.50,0:37:11.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是一根小针头\N{\fs50}It's just a little needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.97,0:37:14.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fs50}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.93,0:37:19.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你很安全\N{\fs50}You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:26.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fs50}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:07.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,十张\N{\fs50}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.13,0:39:19.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有别的活儿吗？\N{\fs50}You got anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.53,0:39:20.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今天没了\N{\fs50}Nothin' today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:22.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明天我们有扫大街\N{\fs50}Tomorrow, we got street sweeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.68,0:39:25.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有下水道维修\N{\fs50}or sewer maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.35,0:39:27.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪个报酬更多？\N{\fs50}Which pays more?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.14,0:39:28.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弄屎的那个\N{\fs50}That'd be the one with the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:34.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,晚一班 下午四点开始\N{\fs50}Late crew. 4 P.M. start.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.45,0:39:45.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\shad0\c&H525750\3c&Hffffff\4c&Hffffff\b1\fs108\frz354.2\pos(1412.8,568.4)}宵禁时间\N晚六点到早六点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.45,0:39:45.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\shad0\c&H525750\3c&Hffffff\4c&Hffffff\b1\fs80\frz354.2\pos(1441.6,914)}任何人未经FEDRA允许上街\N都将被立即逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.08,0:39:47.95,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\shad0\c&H01112d\3c&Hffffff\fscx102\fscy110\b1\frz359.3\fs108\frx0\fry8\pos(1464,448.4)}举报真菌感染迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.08,0:39:47.95,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\shad0\fs70\c&H020e28\3c&Hffffff\4c&Hffffff\b1\pos(1259.2,946)\frz1.173\frx358\fry4}咳嗽不停\N口齿不清\N肌肉痉挛\N情绪波动\N安全从你开始
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.09,0:39:57.63,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&H58522a\3c&Hffffff\4c&Hffffff\fs108\b1\frx2\fry2\pos(1214.4,642)}普通鞋带 1张配给卡\N靴子鞋带 2张配给卡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.10,0:40:11.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杰森·崔\N{\fs50}Jason Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:15.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,违反条例EMC342.3\N{\fs50}violation of EMC 342.3,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:18.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,未经许可离开隔离区\N{\fs50}unauthorized exit from a Quarantine Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.32,0:40:19.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚·埃利西亚诺\N{\fs50}Maria Elisiano,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.07,0:40:23.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,违反条例EMC342.7\N{\fs50}violation of EMC 342.7,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.41,0:40:26.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,未经许可进入隔离区\N{\fs50}unauthorized entry into a Quarantine Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.49,0:40:29.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们都在军事法庭上接受了审判\N{\fs50}Each of you have been tried in a military court of justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.50,0:40:33.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并都被军事法庭陪审团认定有罪\N{\fs50}and each of you having been found guilty by the court martial panel,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.67,0:40:35.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,将被处以死刑\N{\fs50}and with a sentence of death by execution,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.75,0:40:40.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,根据EMPA第1条第5款的授权……\N{\fs50}as empowered under the EMPA, Article 1, Section 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.48,0:40:56.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fs50}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.70,0:41:04.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不然我就当场毙了你\N{\fs50}Or I could just shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.11,0:41:05.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你之后该怎么办呢？\N{\fs50}Yeah, but then what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.78,0:41:08.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你少了五张\N{\fs50}You're short five.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.57,0:41:26.39,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1528,594)}不得入内\N{\fs32}授权人员除外
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.57,0:41:26.39,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1524.8,499.6)\fs48}危险
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.57,0:41:26.39,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\pos(387.2,610)\frz359.6}洒水器\N4号控制室
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.64,0:41:30.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,氧合的？\N{\fs50}Oxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.98,0:41:31.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,氢合的\N{\fs50}Hydro.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.39,0:41:33.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放多久了？\N{\fs50}How old?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.04,0:41:33.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,三个月\N{\fs50}Three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.94,0:41:34.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亚特兰大的？\N{\fs50}From Atlanta?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.79,0:41:35.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道他哪儿弄来的\N{\fs50}I don't know where he gets 'em from.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.73,0:41:36.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只知道是真货\N{\fs50}I just know they're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.86,0:41:38.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果是真货 那就是亚特兰大的\N{\fs50}If it's real, it's from Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.32,0:41:40.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA在那边的隔离区有个工厂\N{\fs50}FEDRA's got a factory down there in the QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.32,0:41:40.82,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA：Federal Disaster Response Agency（联邦灾害应变署）的缩写，\N是控制隔离区和美国军队的机构，也是前美国政府的残余组成部分
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.69,0:41:42.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,据说只产两样东西\N{\fs50}Supposedly only makes two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.61,0:41:46.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,药片与子弹 子弹与药片\N{\fs50}Pills and bullets, bullets and pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.74,0:41:49.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜 你杀的人越多 入睡就越难\N{\fs50}Well, the more you shoot people, the harder it is to sleep, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.29,0:41:51.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还用猜？\N{\fs50}You guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.45,0:41:53.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到底要不要？\N{\fs50}You want 'em or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.13,0:42:00.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,袋子得还我\N{\fs50}I need the bag back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.18,0:42:06.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,车子准备得怎么样了？\N{\fs50}How we doin' with the vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.45,0:42:07.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都弄好了\N{\fs50}All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.18,0:42:09.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,修车厂就差最后一个人要收买\N{\fs50}Just had to get one last guy in the depot to buy in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:10.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 要多少钱？\N{\fs50}Okay, how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.85,0:42:13.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们四个加上我……\N{\fs50}Four of them on that shift plus me...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.48,0:42:14.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一共六百张\N{\fs50}six hundred total.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.60,0:42:18.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 那些卡车当破烂堆着是有原因的\N{\fs50}Look, those trucks are shitheaped for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.23,0:42:20.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且车上没电池 我知道\N{\fs50}And they don't have any batteries. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.27,0:42:22.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我给其他人两百张……\N{\fs50}I can see about 200 for the other guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.73,0:42:23.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给你两百张\N{\fs50}two hundred for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.53,0:42:26.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fs50}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:30.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 听我句劝\N{\fs50}Hey, do yourself a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.58,0:42:33.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这几天晚上就别上街了\N{\fs50}stay off the streets for the next few nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.87,0:42:36.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操蛋火萤一整周都在到处搞爆炸\N{\fs50}Fuckin' Fireflies been blowin' shit up all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.54,0:42:37.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今早我们有两人中了枪\N{\fs50}Two of our guys got shot this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.92,0:42:39.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老大让我们连值两轮班\N{\fs50}Boss has got us working doubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.92,0:42:41.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大家都又累又敏感\N{\fs50}Guys are jumpy and tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:44.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,黑灯瞎火的 很容易误会\N{\fs50}It's easy to make a mistake in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.47,0:42:48.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fs50}Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.39,0:42:50.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 你也是\N{\fs50}Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.65,0:43:03.98,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs108\b1\c&H539ab6\pos(1406.4,614.8)}当你迷失在黑暗中时\N就寻找光明
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.70,0:43:13.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想要我说什么 泰丝？\N{\fs50}What do you want me to say, Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.24,0:43:16.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我什么都没要你说\N{\fs50}I'm not askin' you to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:19.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fs50}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.50,0:43:26.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我本来没打算要敲你竹杠\N{\fs50}It's not like I planned on rippin' you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.63,0:43:28.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.97,0:43:30.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fs50}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.01,0:43:34.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就让事情过去怎样？\N{\fs50}how about we just let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.65,0:43:44.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还能怎么做？\N{\fs50}What else are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.69,0:43:45.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要把我留在这儿？\N{\fs50}Ya gonna keep me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.86,0:43:46.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杀了我？\N{\fs50}Kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.63,0:43:48.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝 别这样\N{\fs50}Tess, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.32,0:43:50.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 罗伯特 你要怎样？\N{\fs50}Then, Robert, what do ya want?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.53,0:43:51.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我希望你把这事彻底忘了\N{\fs50}I want you to forget this ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.99,0:43:53.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经忘了\N{\fs50}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.41,0:43:54.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fs50}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.14,0:43:54.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.83,0:43:57.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是块卡车电池而已 我付了钱给你\N{\fs50}It's just a truck battery. I paid you for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.41,0:43:59.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你卖给了别人 还花了我的钱\N{\fs50}you sold it to someone else, and you spent my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.37,0:44:00.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 你以为这种破事我没干过？\N{\fs50}I mean, you think I've never done shit like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.04,0:44:02.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我手下揍了你\N{\fs50}My guys fucked you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.27,0:44:03.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 那就教他们规矩\N{\fs50}Yeah, so discipline them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.50,0:44:05.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,砍他们根手指 或者随你他妈做啥\N{\fs50}You cut off a finger or whatever the fuck you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.67,0:44:08.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我无所谓 反正是你的人\N{\fs50}I don't care. They're your fuckin' guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.17,0:44:10.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你的人呢？因为他要看见你这样\N{\fs50}What about your guy? 'Cause when he sees you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.88,0:44:12.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 站在我的立场考虑下\N{\fs50}I mean, put yourself in my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.28,0:44:13.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 他听我的话\N{\fs50}Look, he answers to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.68,0:44:17.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我向你保证他不会碰你\N{\fs50}So, I give you my word that he won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.10,0:44:21.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会告诉他我被随便什么人偷袭了\N{\fs50}I'll tell him that I got jumped by some guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.98,0:44:24.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后咱们这事儿就他妈这么过去了\N{\fs50}and then you and I can just move the fuck on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.40,0:44:30.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了 你的破事基本上把我这一周都毁了\N{\fs50}Now your shit has pretty much ruined my week,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.86,0:44:34.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就想回家喝酒 喝到我的脸不疼为止\N{\fs50}and I'd like to go home and drink 'til my face stops hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.99,0:44:36.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 我们完事没？\N{\fs50}So, are we good?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.42,0:44:43.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.26,0:44:58.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有公民必须\N{\fs50}All citizens must clear
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.06,0:45:01.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马上离开外围区域\N{\fs50}the surrounding area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:03.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在FEDRA当局允许前不得返回\N{\fs50}Do not return until FEDRA authorities permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.82,0:45:12.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有公民必须马上离开外围区域\N{\fs50}All citizens must clear the surrounding area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.36,0:45:15.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在FEDRA当局允许前不得返回\N{\fs50}Do not return until FEDRA authorities permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.99,0:45:22.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有公民必须马上离开外围区域\N{\fs50}All citizens must clear the surrounding area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.08,0:45:24.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在FEDRA当局允许前不得返回\N{\fs50}Do not return until FEDRA authorities permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.25,0:45:32.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有公民必须马上离开外围区域\N{\fs50}All citizens must clear the surrounding area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.30,0:45:35.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在FEDRA当局允许前不得返回\N{\fs50}Do not return until FEDRA authorities permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.51,0:45:42.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有公民必须马上离开外围区域\N{\fs50}All citizens must clear the surrounding area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.73,0:45:45.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在FEDRA当局允许前不得返回\N{\fs50}Do not return until FEDRA authorities permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.85,0:45:46.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fs50}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.23,0:45:49.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是火萤 在上边！\N{\fs50}Firefly, up top!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.78,0:45:52.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,立刻解放波士顿 狗娘养的！\N{\fs50}Free Boston now, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.33,0:46:06.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在开枪 他们在朝我们开枪\N{\fs50}They're shooting. They're shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.02,0:46:06.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跪在地上\N{\fs50}On your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.37,0:46:07.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跪在地上！\N{\fs50}On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.31,0:46:08.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不！我不是火——\N{\fs50}No, no! I'm not a F--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.21,0:46:14.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不是火萤！\N{\fs50}I'm not a Firefly!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.33,0:46:46.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,缓慢且清楚地从1数到10\N{\fs50}Count slowly and clearly from one to 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.00,0:46:47.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四——\N{\fs50}One, two, three, four--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.98,0:46:48.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,缓慢\N{\fs50}Slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.92,0:46:50.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,且清楚\N{\fs50}and clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.67,0:46:52.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fs50}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.38,0:46:54.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fs50}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.88,0:46:55.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,三\N{\fs50}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.47,0:46:57.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,四\N{\fs50}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.93,0:46:58.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,五\N{\fs50}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.26,0:47:00.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,六\N{\fs50}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.72,0:47:01.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,七\N{\fs50}Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.35,0:47:03.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,八\N{\fs50}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.56,0:47:04.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操……\N{\fs50}Fuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.93,0:47:06.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fs50}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.39,0:47:09.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后伸出你的——\N{\fs50}And hold out your--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.48,0:47:13.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 说出你的名字 缓慢且清楚地说 - 维罗妮卡\N{\fs50}-State your name, slowly and clearly. -Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.65,0:47:17.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和昨天一样 和前天也一样\N{\fs50}Same as yesterday, and the day before,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.03,0:47:19.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和大前天也一样 还有大大——\N{\fs50}and the day before, and the--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:22.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 会有人来找我的\N{\fs50}Hey, people are gonna come looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.53,0:47:24.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA的人 你听到了吗？\N{\fs50}People from FEDRA. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.24,0:47:26.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放我出去 不然你们会付出代价 狗娘养的！\N{\fs50}Let me out or you're gonna pay, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.92,0:47:31.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我根本不该在这里！\N{\fs50}I'm not supposed to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.09,0:47:41.59,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs92\c&H040320\b1\pos(1134.4,438.8)}当你迷失在黑暗中时
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.37,0:48:06.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 要排队的！\N{\fs50}Hey, there's a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.04,0:48:08.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“告诉爸爸，是个女孩\N{\fs50}"Tell Dad it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.37,0:48:11.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“那样很好，对吗？\N{\fs50}"That would be good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.62,0:48:13.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“他一直想要个孙女\N{\fs50}"He wanted a granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.84,0:48:15.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爱你的，贝卡。”\N{\fs50}Love, Becca."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.71,0:48:17.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,结束留言 复读\N{\fs50}End message. Read back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.93,0:48:24.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,留言正确 73-K奥兰多 完毕\N{\fs50}Correct, 73-K Orlando. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.07,0:48:44.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么都没有？\N{\fs50}Nothin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.37,0:48:47.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有没有可能消息晚上来的？\N{\fs50}Is there any chance it's comin' in at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.04,0:48:49.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你睡着了 就错过了？\N{\fs50}You're sleepin', you miss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.71,0:48:57.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我睡觉的时候 加布里埃拉在听 或者是我的儿子\N{\fs50}When I'm sleeping, Gabriela listens, or my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.63,0:48:59.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,聪明的那个 不是另一个 上帝保佑\N{\fs50}The smart one, not the other one, God bless him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.47,0:49:03.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果汤米回消息了 我们会知道的\N{\fs50}If Tommy responded, we'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:05.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你和塔那边也有联系？ - 每天都有\N{\fs50}-And you're talkin' to the tower? -Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.85,0:49:07.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们转达了你的消息 他们之后就没看见过他\N{\fs50}They gave him your message, they haven't seen or heard
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.60,0:49:09.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或者听到消息 就这样\N{\fs50}from him since, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.39,0:49:11.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也没过多久\N{\fs50}It hasn't been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.62,0:49:12.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经三周了\N{\fs50}It's been three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.06,0:49:14.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他从未失联超过一天\N{\fs50}It's never taken him more than a day to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.81,0:49:17.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我确信他没事\N{\fs50}I'm sure he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.03,0:49:25.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我看看塔在哪儿\N{\fs50}Show me where the tower is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.70,0:49:27.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不是认真的吧\N{\fs50}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:31.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 塔在怀俄明州\N{\fs50}Joel, it's in Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.79,0:49:34.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么多开放区？\N{\fs50}All this open country?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.67,0:49:36.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 你很有本事\N{\fs50}I mean, you're a capable guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.58,0:49:38.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但外边有比感染者更可怕的东西\N{\fs50}but there are worse things than Infected out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.05,0:49:40.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在这上头啥都能听着\N{\fs50}I hear everything on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.88,0:49:42.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,外边有强盗 有蓄奴的——\N{\fs50}There are raiders, there are slavers--
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.84,0:49:44.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你“确信”汤米没事？\N{\fs50}But you're "sure" Tommy's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.10,0:49:54.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是科迪塔\N{\fs50}It's the Cody tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.85,0:49:58.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在第四隔离区 但我不清楚具体——\N{\fs50}Q-Bar 4, but I don't know exactly wh--
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.70,0:50:05.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下一位！\N{\fs50}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.30,0:51:49.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 乔尔……\N{\fs50}You know what, Joel...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.39,0:51:52.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.36,0:52:52.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我被几个人偷袭了\N{\fs50}I got jumped by a couple guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:53.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么人？\N{\fs50}What guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.55,0:52:55.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是几个小屁孩\N{\fs50}Just a couple teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.24,0:52:57.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随口说了几句 也许不该的\N{\fs50}Said some shit, probably shouldn't've.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.20,0:53:01.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,算了吧 你知道这些人是疫情爆发后出生的\N{\fs50}Come on. You know these guys were born after the outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.66,0:53:04.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没学过吵架 就开始抡拳头了\N{\fs50}Never learned how to argue. They just start swingin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.08,0:53:05.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一帮19岁的混账东西\N{\fs50}Fuckin' 19-year-old pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.34,0:53:08.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还活着是个奇迹\N{\fs50}It's a miracle you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.76,0:53:11.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们任何一个人活着都是奇迹\N{\fs50}It's a miracle any of us are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.05,0:53:15.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些伤口不是新的\N{\fs50}These aren't new.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.97,0:53:16.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.85,0:53:20.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在FEDRA的拘留所待了一整天\N{\fs50}I was in FEDRA lockup all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.89,0:53:22.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过 这些也无所谓了\N{\fs50}Anyway, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.52,0:53:25.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我需要你冷静下来\N{\fs50}I need you to take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.76,0:53:26.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.32,0:53:29.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔——\N{\fs50}Joel--
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.71,0:53:30.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.53,0:53:34.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,偷袭我的是罗伯特的人\N{\fs50}The guys who jumped me were with Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:36.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他把我们的电池卖给了别人\N{\fs50}He sold our battery to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.41,0:53:41.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的 这种逼事常有\N{\fs50}Nothing's lost. Shit like this is gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.87,0:53:43.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在我们振作起来\N{\fs50}Now we just shake it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.50,0:53:45.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后拿回我们的卡 或者电池\N{\fs50}and we go get our cards back, or the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:47.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我需要那个电池 泰丝\N{\fs50}I need the battery, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.21,0:53:49.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,缺了那玩意儿 车子根本没法用\N{\fs50}Truck's no good without one,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.84,0:53:51.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我不尽快找到汤米 他可能就死在外面了\N{\fs50}and if I don't get to Tommy soon, he's gonna die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.96,0:53:52.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 操他的\N{\fs50}Okay, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.92,0:53:54.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会把钱和电池都拿回来\N{\fs50}We get our money back and the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.88,0:53:55.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是 乔尔 听好了\N{\fs50}But, Joel, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.97,0:53:58.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,罗伯特对你怕得不行\N{\fs50}Robert is terrified of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.10,0:53:59.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 你要是跟克林特·伊斯特伍德似地走出去\N{\fs50}So, you march outta here all Clint Eastwood,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.93,0:54:01.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他肯定会听到风声 悄悄开溜\N{\fs50}he's gonna get wind of it and skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.77,0:54:03.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我需要你放松下来\N{\fs50}I need you to take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.77,0:54:10.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他把电池卖给谁了？\N{\fs50}Who'd he sell it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.84,0:54:11.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fs50}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.57,0:54:12.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 那他在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Well, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.42,0:54:13.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fs50}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.49,0:54:15.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,暂时\N{\fs50}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.32,0:54:19.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会把他揪出来 别冒冒失失的\N{\fs50}But we're gonna find out, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.53,0:54:20.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fs50}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.29,0:54:24.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虽然我向罗伯特保证过你不会动他\N{\fs50}Now I promised Robert that you wouldn't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.71,0:54:28.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我希望你把他好好收拾一顿\N{\fs50}But I would very much like for you to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.92,0:54:31.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 把那个王八蛋揪出来\N{\fs50}So let's go hunt that motherfucker down,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.96,0:54:34.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拿回我们的电池 我们的车\N{\fs50}and get our battery and our truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.67,0:54:36.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我们就动身去找汤米\N{\fs50}and then we'll go find Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.05,0:54:37.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吗？\N{\fs50}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.01,0:54:41.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.71,0:55:07.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,东南3号区的人到位了没？\N{\fs50}The team in place at Southeast 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.87,0:55:09.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我让他们先待命\N{\fs50}I held them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.17,0:55:12.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有话要问\N{\fs50}I have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.59,0:55:14.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.97,0:55:18.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一直在炸毁无意义的FEDRA目标\N{\fs50}We've been blowing up meaningless FEDRA targets
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.09,0:55:20.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些目标遍布整个隔离区 炸了整整两周\N{\fs50}spread out all over the QZ, for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.47,0:55:22.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经损失了四个人 可我们还要——\N{\fs50}We've already lost four people, and we're--
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.68,0:55:24.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么做有什么意义？\N{\fs50}What's the point of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.35,0:55:28.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是你想问的？\N{\fs50}Is that your question?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.10,0:55:29.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其中之一\N{\fs50}That's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.85,0:55:31.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的回答是 他妈的服从命令\N{\fs50}My answer is to follow fuckin' orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.15,0:55:34.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有 你为什么把个不知来路的丫头锁在房间里？\N{\fs50}And why do you have some random girl locked in a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.11,0:55:36.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你安排看守她的人连个屁都不跟我放？\N{\fs50}And the guys you have guarding her won't tell me shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.90,0:55:40.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们的人一直在问我究竟是什么情况 我什么都说不出\N{\fs50}Our people are asking what's going on, and I don't know what to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.53,0:55:42.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让他们执行他妈的命令\N{\fs50}Tell them to follow fuckin' orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.91,0:55:45.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们俩 去东南3号区 马上\N{\fs50}You two, go to Southeast 3. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.29,0:55:53.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 金 - 玛琳\N{\fs50}-Kim. -Marlene.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.21,0:55:55.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们正处在反抗军事独裁的斗争中\N{\fs50}We are in a war against a military dictatorship
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.88,0:55:57.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为的是重建民主和自由\N{\fs50}to restore democracy and freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.76,0:55:58.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这话对不对？\N{\fs50}Does that sound about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.76,0:55:59.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后？\N{\fs50}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.28,0:55:59.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们赢了吗？\N{\fs50}Are we winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.84,0:56:00.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们打败本地的FEDRA了吗？\N{\fs50}Are we beating FEDRA here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.05,0:56:02.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有哪儿的火萤击败了FEDRA吗？\N{\fs50}Are the Fireflies beating FEDRA anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.64,0:56:03.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反抗不是一朝一夕\N{\fs50}Rebellion takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.95,0:56:04.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你已经战斗20年了\N{\fs50}You fight for 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:06.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪里都没有打下来 这不是反抗\N{\fs50}and you get nowhere, you're not a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.72,0:56:08.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只不过是涂鸦\N{\fs50}Just spray paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.52,0:56:11.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们并没有与FEDRA在隔离区“全境”作战\N{\fs50}We're not hitting FEDRA "all over" the QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.06,0:56:15.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而是在这 这 这 这 以及这里袭击他们\N{\fs50}We hit 'em here, here, here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.48,0:56:17.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们现在在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where are we right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.57,0:56:21.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在其他地方袭击FEDRA都可以 就是这里不行\N{\fs50}I want FEDRA everywhere but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.03,0:56:24.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要FEDRA的注意力尽可能从这里移开 因为今晚\N{\fs50}I want them as distracted as possible because tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.78,0:56:27.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,波士顿的每一位火萤成员都要集合到这座建筑里\N{\fs50}every Firefly in Boston is gonna gather in this building,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.29,0:56:29.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要离开这个隔离区 不再回来\N{\fs50}and we are gonna leave the QZ. Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.79,0:56:31.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要撤退了？\N{\fs50}We're quitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.65,0:56:32.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.54,0:56:35.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要带着锁在房间里的那个小丫头往西走\N{\fs50}We're taking that random girl locked in that room west.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.55,0:56:39.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我们的人从塞勒姆的无线电塔发来的\N{\fs50}From our guy in the radio tower in Salem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.43,0:56:49.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？\N{\fs50}Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.60,0:56:52.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我相信是真的\N{\fs50}I believe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.65,0:56:56.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别告诉其他人\N{\fs50}Keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.11,0:57:01.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论你需要什么\N{\fs50}Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.99,0:57:03.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\fs50}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.45,0:57:05.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会把她送到该去的地方\N{\fs50}We'll get her where she needs to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.77,0:57:35.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友\N{\fs50}Hey, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.61,0:57:39.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别担心 我什么都不要\N{\fs50}Don't worry. I don't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.82,0:57:41.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当你迷失在——\N{\fs50}But if you're feelin' lost--
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.49,0:57:44.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,敢跟我说“就寻找光明” 我就打断你下巴\N{\fs50}You tell me to "look for the light" and I'll break your jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.71,0:57:58.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃 花了几张卡 但拿到那家伙的线索了\N{\fs50}Well, it cost us a couple of cards, but we got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.79,0:58:01.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,据说他要把电池带到一座有红色标记的楼里\N{\fs50}He's supposedly takin' the battery to a red-tagged building.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.05,0:58:05.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,记住地址 在斯第曼街和十字街交口\N{\fs50}But get this, corner of Stillman and Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.26,0:58:06.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,米格尔待过的那栋楼\N{\fs50}The one Miguel used to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.01,0:58:08.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 我也觉得是\N{\fs50}Yeah, I'm thinkin' so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.76,0:58:10.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以走干草市场地下的那条地铁隧道\N{\fs50}We can take the subway tunnel under Haymarket,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.85,0:58:13.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从地下进大楼 给罗伯特一个惊喜\N{\fs50}get into the building from below, and take Robert by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.52,0:58:15.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好好回报这个混蛋\N{\fs50}Pay this fucker back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.24,0:58:25.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\fs50}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.70,0:58:32.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啊！你个混蛋！\N{\fs50}Agh! You fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.88,0:58:41.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四——\N{\fs50}One, two, three, four--
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.53,0:59:10.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不怕我\N{\fs50}You're not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.83,0:59:15.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就解开铁链\N{\fs50}Then unlock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.62,0:59:17.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不如先说一句“谢谢你”？\N{\fs50}How about we start with "thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.25,0:59:18.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凭什么？\N{\fs50}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.58,0:59:20.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凭我救了你一命？\N{\fs50}For saving your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.33,0:59:21.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我让他们别朝你开枪\N{\fs50}I am the one who told 'em not to shoot you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.84,0:59:22.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得\N{\fs50}if you recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.57,0:59:23.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.14,0:59:32.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么要阻止他们？\N{\fs50}Why did you stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.47,0:59:34.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,晚点说这个\N{\fs50}We'll get to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.82,0:59:50.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么 维罗妮卡\N{\fs50}So, Veronica,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.41,0:59:54.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样？\N{\fs50}how ya feelin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.50,0:59:57.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没变化\N{\fs50}The same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.71,1:00:01.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会死吗？\N{\fs50}Is it gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.50,1:00:04.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.80,1:00:08.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我能走吗？\N{\fs50}So, can I go?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.93,1:00:10.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.01,1:00:12.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会和任何人说起这个事情\N{\fs50}I won't tell anyone about any of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.89,1:00:14.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.10,1:00:15.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你打算去哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.26,1:00:16.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,回到FEDRA的军校？\N{\fs50}Back to FEDRA military school?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.02,1:00:18.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就那么想当个士兵？\N{\fs50}You that anxious to be a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.25,1:00:20.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得那是我选的？\N{\fs50}You think I chose that place?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.23,1:00:21.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还是个婴儿的时候 就被他们送到那了\N{\fs50}They put me there when I was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.06,1:00:23.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那地方是给孤儿的\N{\fs50}It's for orphans.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.36,1:00:25.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是“他们”把你送到那\N{\fs50}"They" didn't put you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.11,1:00:28.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我做的\N{\fs50}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.07,1:00:30.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.03,1:00:35.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈是我亲妈还是什么？\N{\fs50}You my fucking mom or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.24,1:00:38.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看起来像是你妈？\N{\fs50}Do I look like your mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.75,1:00:40.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是不像\N{\fs50}Nooo, you do not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.92,1:00:43.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫玛琳\N{\fs50}My name is Marlene.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.67,1:00:46.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,波士顿隔离区的火萤组织领导人\N{\fs50}I'm the leader of the Fireflies in the Boston QZ.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.38,1:00:49.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么一个恐怖分子要把我丢给FEDRA？\N{\fs50}Why would a terrorist dump me with FEDRA?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.26,1:00:51.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为那儿对你最安全 事实也的确如此\N{\fs50}Because it's where you'd be safest, and you were safe there
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.43,1:00:52.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,结果你偷偷溜了出来\N{\fs50}until you decided to sneak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.68,1:00:54.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有 “恐怖分子”？\N{\fs50}And "terrorist"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.05,1:00:56.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你认为莱莉也是恐怖分子吗？\N{\fs50}Was Riley a terrorist?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.16,1:01:15.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么不让我回家？\N{\fs50}Why won't you let me go home?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.91,1:01:22.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为你身上有一项我们任何人都想象不到的重大使命\N{\fs50}Because you have a greater purpose than any of us could've ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.33,1:01:26.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 我们会在今晚出发 带上你一起走\N{\fs50}So we're leaving tonight, and we're taking you with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.46,1:01:30.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他到了\N{\fs50}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.11,1:01:31.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等我五分钟\N{\fs50}Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.05,1:01:38.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我将要告诉你的话 绝对不能让其他人知道\N{\fs50}What I'm about to tell you cannot be repeated to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.26,1:01:42.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你跟别人说了 我向你保证\N{\fs50}Because if you do, I assure you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.10,1:01:45.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会没命\N{\fs50}you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.40,1:01:49.55,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,526.8)}干草市场 入口 B38\N{\fs50}西南维护站\N未经授权不得进入\N仅限马萨诸塞湾交通局员工进入
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.04,1:02:09.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.13,1:02:11.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fs50}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.55,1:02:12.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.02,1:02:31.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fs50}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:57.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Oh fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.38,1:02:58.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fs50}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.64,1:03:01.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这货死透了\N{\fs50}This one's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.27,1:03:05.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.02,1:03:07.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是——\N{\fs50}I know. I just--
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.27,1:03:08.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没料到会有这个\N{\fs50}I wasn't expecting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.85,1:03:10.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看来上次它不在？\N{\fs50}Take it he wasn't down here last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.69,1:03:12.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不在\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.28,1:03:17.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得它是在被感染后才来到地下？\N{\fs50}You think he came down after he was infected?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.32,1:03:21.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许它是来地下以后才被感染的\N{\fs50}Well, maybe down here is where he was infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.54,1:03:28.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了 走吧\N{\fs50}Let's keep movin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.22,1:03:44.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看上去他们调了整个结构\N{\fs50}It's like they reframed the whole structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.72,1:03:46.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能是在80年代改的\N{\fs50}Probably in the '80s.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.23,1:03:48.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们缩减出租型公寓的面积\N{\fs50}Everyone was cutting down on apartment sizes
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.10,1:03:49.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为的是能卖出更多出售型公寓\N{\fs50}to sell more condos.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.98,1:03:54.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“感谢乔尔·米勒带来的'建筑小知识'”\N{\fs50}"This has been 'Construction Corner' with Joel Miller."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.65,1:03:55.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们还要爬多远？\N{\fs50}How far up we goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.53,1:03:59.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fs50}This far.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.53,1:04:06.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧 这个入口通向走廊\N{\fs50}So, this opens into the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.37,1:04:10.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈搞什么鬼？有人用钢琴挡住门吗？\N{\fs50}What the fuck? Someone put a piano in front of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.34,1:04:14.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗？\N{\fs50}You smell that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.55,1:04:18.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 是火药\N{\fs50}Yeah, gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.22,1:04:26.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝\N{\fs50}Tess.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.45,1:04:48.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哦 这电池没法用了\N{\fs50}Well, the battery's no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.75,1:04:51.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可他依然试图卖掉\N{\fs50}And he still tried to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.50,1:04:53.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还卖了两次\N{\fs50}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.67,1:04:56.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,贪婪的混蛋\N{\fs50}You greedy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.43,1:05:11.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.64,1:05:13.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fs50}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.11,1:05:17.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 来吧\N{\fs50}Shit, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.87,1:05:25.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.58,1:05:29.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.87,1:05:31.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳？\N{\fs50}Marlene?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.04,1:05:34.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fs50}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.77,1:05:35.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.50,1:05:39.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.01,1:05:41.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.47,1:05:44.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fs50}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.41,1:05:46.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事 我还好 别担心我\N{\fs50}No, it's okay. I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.39,1:05:48.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不能干这种蠢事\N{\fs50}And you can't be stupid like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.85,1:05:52.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以罗伯特为了这人把我们都耍了？\N{\fs50}So this is who Robert screwed us over with?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.43,1:05:54.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为了波士顿的切·格瓦拉？\N{\fs50}The Che Guevara of Boston?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.39,1:05:55.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这打的什么破仗\N{\fs50}War must be goin' pretty shitty
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.90,1:05:57.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你居然跟这种人渣买东西\N{\fs50}for you to be buying from scumbags like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.77,1:05:58.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 大概是这样\N{\fs50}Yeah, it kinda has been.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.02,1:06:00.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,货的质量很差\N{\fs50}The merch was bad,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.57,1:06:02.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且 显然他没把“滚蛋”听进去\N{\fs50}and he obviously didn't take "fuck off" for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.32,1:06:02.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把我的刀还我\N{\fs50}Gimme my knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.97,1:06:04.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要卡车电池做什么？\N{\fs50}What do you need a car battery for?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.25,1:06:05.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fs50}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.64,1:06:06.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别指她\N{\fs50}Not at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.87,1:06:10.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,冲着我好了\N{\fs50}Point it at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.13,1:06:25.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,回答你的问题 我有比你更需要电池的理由\N{\fs50}And to answer your question, I need it for a better reason than you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.88,1:06:27.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 可汤米只是一个普通人\N{\fs50}No offense, but Tommy's just one man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.89,1:06:30.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,了解情况的是我们\N{\fs50}It's our business to know things.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.20,1:06:31.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“了解情况”\N{\fs50}"To know things."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.93,1:06:34.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都是你害的 让我亲弟弟跟我闹翻\N{\fs50}You're the cause of it. You turned my own brother against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.27,1:06:34.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 乔尔\N{\fs50}Okay, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.92,1:06:35.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚刚的阵仗太大了\N{\fs50}That was a lot of gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.81,1:06:36.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA恐怕在赶来的路上了\N{\fs50}FEDRA's gonna be on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.83,1:06:37.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fs50}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.94,1:06:45.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,本来我们今晚要带艾莉离开隔离区\N{\fs50}We were gonna move Ellie outta the zone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.20,1:06:48.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但现在这个情况 我们去不了任何地方 至少短期内不行\N{\fs50}But we won't make it anywhere like this. Not for a while anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.24,1:06:51.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 我现在想的是 这个任务可以交给你们\N{\fs50}So now I'm thinkin', you're gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.66,1:06:52.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 别扯淡 - 我才不要和他们走！\N{\fs50}-The hell we are. -I'm not goin' with them!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.74,1:06:53.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以带她走\N{\fs50}-Let me take her. -Tess, we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.35,1:06:54.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝 我们没时间管这码事\N{\fs50}Tess, we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.96,1:06:56.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们没时间？\N{\fs50}You don't have time?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.16,1:06:57.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 这女孩是谁？ - 对你们来说 她就是个货物\N{\fs50}-Who is she? -To you? She's cargo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.42,1:06:58.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不做走私人的生意 抱歉\N{\fs50}We don't smuggle people. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.92,1:06:59.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fs50}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.61,1:07:01.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,金 他妈的你脑袋上已经少了只耳朵了\N{\fs50}Kim, you don't have a fuckin' ear on your fuckin' head.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.71,1:07:02.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你能不能听我说？\N{\fs50}Could you please?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.09,1:07:06.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有一只火萤小队在老州议会大厦等着她\N{\fs50}There's a team of Fireflies waiting for her at the old State House.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.01,1:07:08.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道外边有什么\N{\fs50}I know what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.80,1:07:11.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是因为这个 我们才要全员出动\N{\fs50}We were going with an entire squadron for that very reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.89,1:07:13.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可我现在没有卡车 也没有人手\N{\fs50}But now I don't have a truck, I don't have a squadron,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.64,1:07:14.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA一眨眼就要到了\N{\fs50}FEDRA's five minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.98,1:07:16.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我现在只有你\N{\fs50}What I do have is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.98,1:07:19.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你俩擅长做什么\N{\fs50}And I know what you're both capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.69,1:07:21.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好事坏事就不论了\N{\fs50}For better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.03,1:07:25.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们能做什么？\N{\fs50}What are they capable of?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.69,1:07:28.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你把她安全带到地方 他们会提供你想要的东西\N{\fs50}You get her there safely, and they'll give you what you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.53,1:07:30.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是电池 全套都有\N{\fs50}Not just a battery. The whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.49,1:07:33.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,加满油的卡车 枪 补给 全部都有\N{\fs50}Fueled-up truck, guns, supplies, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.24,1:07:34.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.33,1:07:38.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.42,1:07:47.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,臭傻逼！\N{\fs50}Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.51,1:07:55.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你相信她？\N{\fs50}You trust her?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.18,1:07:57.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 我也不相信 但她似乎在孤注一掷\N{\fs50}No, me neither, but she seems desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.18,1:07:59.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,火萤的车通常是用FEDRA的改装的\N{\fs50}Firefly vehicle usually means repurposed FEDRA stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.85,1:08:02.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有这么一辆车 我们或许更容易找到汤米\N{\fs50}So better-than-decent chance makin' it to Tommy in one of those.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.31,1:08:03.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一旦我们把这个孩子交到他们手上——\N{\fs50}The second we hand that kid over--
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.90,1:08:06.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你俩好好谈着 但别忘了我的血还在往外淌\N{\fs50}Y'all talk it through, but please remember that I'm bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.91,1:08:12.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 我们的条件是这样的\N{\fs50}Okay. Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.28,1:08:15.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们把她带到老州议会大厦并交给你的手下\N{\fs50}We'll get her to your crew at the State House.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.33,1:08:18.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,交人之前 他们先把我们要的东西给我们\N{\fs50}But before we hand her over, they give us everything that we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.79,1:08:20.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不干 我们就当场杀了她\N{\fs50}If not, we kill her, there and then.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.75,1:08:21.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fs50}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.23,1:08:22.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啥？这就定了？\N{\fs50}Really? That fast?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.88,1:08:24.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你才是最重要的\N{\fs50}You are all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.63,1:08:26.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们的人不会拿你的生命冒险\N{\fs50}My team will not jeopardize that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:28.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,记得我跟你说的吗？\N{\fs50}Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:29.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快去拿上你的背包\N{\fs50}Now go get your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.72,1:08:32.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,赶紧 艾莉\N{\fs50}Now, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.60,1:08:43.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs50}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.70,1:08:53.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.03,1:08:56.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别他妈搞砸了\N{\fs50}don't fuck this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.91,1:09:00.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托你\N{\fs50}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.30,1:09:52.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给我们一分钟 行不？\N{\fs50}Give us a minute, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.97,1:09:54.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操？！\N{\fs50}What the fuck?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.80,1:09:57.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你有什么计划？\N{\fs50}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.60,1:10:00.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们基本上没得选\N{\fs50}There's not a lot of options.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.52,1:10:02.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有条近路 还有就是那条远路\N{\fs50}There's the short way or the long way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.85,1:10:04.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,近路实在是……\N{\fs50}The short way is pretty much...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.52,1:10:06.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只能走远路了\N{\fs50}That leaves the long way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.10,1:10:08.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,情况看起来很糟 我们得好好想想\N{\fs50}Things look bad, we'll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.11,1:10:09.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱们不着急 先去比尔和弗兰克家\N{\fs50}We'll have to drop, head to Bill and Frank's.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.61,1:10:12.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备好任何可能用得上的物资\N{\fs50}Stock up on anything we may need.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.53,1:10:20.20,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz2.283\fs80\c&H0f0e0e\pos(1366.4,576.4)\b1}《公告牌》\N畅销金曲
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.63,1:10:31.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们天黑后动身 现在你看着这孩子\N{\fs50}We leave after dark. Stay with the kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.88,1:10:34.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 为什么我要—— 泰丝\N{\fs50}Wait. Why do I have to-- Tess.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.63,1:10:39.64,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&H1130e11\fs40\frz342.9\pos(1304,603.6)}60 - 没货\N70 - 新货\N80 - X
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.93,1:10:46.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 比尔和弗兰克是谁？\N{\fs50}So, who's Bill and Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.77,1:10:51.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那个收音机收的是走私的暗号 对吗？\N{\fs50}The radio's a smuggling code, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.86,1:10:53.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,60年代的歌曲 没有任何新货\N{\fs50}'60s song, they don't have anything new,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.57,1:10:54.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,70年代的 新货到了\N{\fs50}'70s, they got new stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.99,1:10:56.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,80年代的是什么意思？\N{\fs50}What's '80s?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:04.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.58,1:11:05.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,打发时间\N{\fs50}Killin' time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.23,1:11:06.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 那么我该做什么？\N{\fs50}Well, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.54,1:11:08.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我相信你自己会找到答案的\N{\fs50}I'm sure you'll figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.92,1:11:17.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的表坏了\N{\fs50}Your watch is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.65,1:11:34.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你睡着的时候一直在说梦话\N{\fs50}You mumble in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.28,1:11:44.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从没去过隔离墙的另一边\N{\fs50}I've never been on the other side of the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.83,1:11:47.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看 那里好暗\N{\fs50}Look how dark it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.38,1:11:55.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们经常去那边吗？\N{\fs50}You guys go out there a lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.13,1:11:57.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fs50}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.65,1:11:59.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上次是什么时候？\N{\fs50}When was the last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.22,1:12:00.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许有一年了 有什么关系吗？\N{\fs50}Maybe a year. What's it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.93,1:12:02.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你知道往哪儿走\N{\fs50}But you know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.76,1:12:05.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我们会没事的\N{\fs50}So we're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.06,1:12:10.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.36,1:12:19.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？\N{\fs50}So what's the deal with you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.82,1:12:21.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是什么大佬的女儿还是怎么地？\N{\fs50}You some kinda bigwig's daughter or somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:25.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fs50}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.96,1:12:36.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对了 你睡着的时候收音机响了\N{\fs50}The radio came on when you were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.09,1:12:38.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.47,1:12:39.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放的是什么歌？\N{\fs50}What was the song?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.51,1:12:40.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,歌一直在唱 大概是什么\N{\fs50}He kept sayin', like,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.63,1:12:43.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“在你走之前 记得叫醒我”\N{\fs50}"Wake me up before you go-go"?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.22,1:12:45.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.60,1:12:47.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fs50}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.06,1:12:50.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,80年代意思是有麻烦\N{\fs50}'80s means trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.06,1:12:50.27,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,Wham!《Wake Me Up Before You Go-Go》发表于1984年
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.02,1:12:52.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,密码破解\N{\fs50}Code broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.61,1:12:56.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着——\N{\fs50}Listen--
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.49,1:13:05.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,兰开斯特街下方的地洞出口似乎比较安全\N{\fs50}The spot under Lancaster looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.16,1:13:06.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你包里有外套吗？\N{\fs50}You got a jacket in your pack?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.31,1:13:07.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.12,1:13:09.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 拿出来穿上 到点出发了\N{\fs50}Okay, get it. It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.55,1:13:25.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,……宵禁令 对抗感染和叛乱\N{\fs50}...mandatory curfew to fight infection and insurrection.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.77,1:13:30.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,遵守宵禁令\N{\fs50}Observe mandatory curfew
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.81,1:13:33.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对抗感染和叛乱\N{\fs50}to fight infection and insurrection.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.02,1:13:38.46,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs108\c&H0f4b79\b1\pos(937.6,509.2)\fscx90\fscy125}欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.65,1:14:25.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操 我真的到墙外了\N{\fs50}Holy shit. I'm actually outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.41,1:14:26.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fs50}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.14,1:14:26.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.99,1:14:33.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我们要绕过缓冲区左侧\N{\fs50}Okay, we're gonna take the left edge around the buffer zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.66,1:14:36.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你跟着我 按我说的做\N{\fs50}You stay close and you follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.50,1:14:37.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 好 没问题\N{\fs50}Yeah. Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.09,1:14:40.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs50}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.34,1:16:12.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fs50}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.60,1:16:13.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 别 别 别动 站住\N{\fs50}Hey, hey! Don't, don't, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.89,1:16:16.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fs50}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.11,1:16:24.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈是在逗我\N{\fs50}You gotta be shittin' me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.86,1:16:26.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 咱们来谈谈\N{\fs50}Okay, let's talk this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.05,1:16:26.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转过去\N{\fs50}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.82,1:16:27.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等——\N{\fs50}Hold on--
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.38,1:16:27.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈的给我跪下\N{\fs50}Get on your fuckin' knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.99,1:16:29.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的给我跪下！\N{\fs50}Get on your fuckin' knees!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.15,1:16:30.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 稍等—— - 老兄 我他妈是怎么跟你说的？\N{\fs50}-Now hold on-- -What did I fuckin' tell you, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.74,1:16:32.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说你他妈应该待在家里\N{\fs50}I said stay the fuck home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.49,1:16:34.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给我跪下！\N{\fs50}Get on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.33,1:16:36.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,先跪下 先跪下\N{\fs50}Just get on your knees, just get on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.20,1:16:38.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听我说 你放了我们这一马\N{\fs50}Listen, you let us do this run,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.00,1:16:40.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们拿到卡以后跟你分\N{\fs50}we'll split the cards with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.54,1:16:41.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 没错\N{\fs50}-Will you? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.83,1:16:42.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我太可幸运了\N{\fs50}I'm so blessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.92,1:16:44.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把手放在头上 眼睛往前看\N{\fs50}Hands on your head. Eyes forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.29,1:16:46.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,手放头上！\N{\fs50}Hands on your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.13,1:16:51.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托 你是认真的？\N{\fs50}Really, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.11,1:16:52.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 这次我们按规矩来\N{\fs50}Yep. We're doin' this by the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.80,1:16:55.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs50}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.47,1:16:56.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你拿四分之三怎么样？\N{\fs50}All right. What about three-quarters?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.22,1:16:59.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,未经许可出隔离区\N{\fs50}Unauthorized exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.85,1:17:00.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会把你们吊死\N{\fs50}They'll hang you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.94,1:17:02.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行了吧 这趟生意 配给卡全归你\N{\fs50}Fine. Everythin' off of this run,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.60,1:17:04.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,药片给你一半\N{\fs50}and half off on all of the pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.21,1:17:04.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给我一半？\N{\fs50}Half off?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.06,1:17:06.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要全部\N{\fs50}All off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.48,1:17:09.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我冒着失业风险 才换一半药片 你他妈脑——\N{\fs50}Risk my job for half off. Outta your fuckin' mind--
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.07,1:17:11.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie, Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.32,1:17:12.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 搞什么——\N{\fs50}Ellie, what the--
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.43,1:17:13.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你妈的贱人！\N{\fs50}Fuckin' bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.41,1:17:14.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.41,1:17:16.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈给我让开！\N{\fs50}Get out of the fuckin' way!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.25,1:17:20.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个问题我们可以解决\N{\fs50}We can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.91,1:17:21.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fs50}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.96,1:17:27.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fs50}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.79,1:18:06.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不！不 我没生病！\N{\fs50}No, no! No, I'm not sick!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.54,1:18:09.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,-  乔尔！乔尔 乔尔！ - 我没病！我没病！\N{\fs50}-Joel! Joel, Joel! -I am not sick! I'm not sick!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.09,1:18:11.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看！看！这已经三周了\N{\fs50}Look! Look! This is three weeks old.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.84,1:18:13.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人能撑过一天！\N{\fs50}Nobody lasts more than a day!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.26,1:18:15.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这难道看着像仅有一天吗？\N{\fs50}Does this look a day old to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.76,1:18:16.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要不然你们早就把我杀了！\N{\fs50}You would've killed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.57,1:18:17.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈是该杀了你！\N{\fs50}I should fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.85,1:18:18.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么时候发生的？\N{\fs50}When did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.83,1:18:20.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那不重要！你得相信我！\N{\fs50}It doesn't matter! You have to trust me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.02,1:18:22.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再不跑的话 他们就要抓住我们了！\N{\fs50}They're gonna catch us if we don't run!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.27,1:18:28.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 我们得走了 要走了 乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel, we gotta move. We gotta move, Joel!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.58,1:18:41.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.52,1:18:52.17,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\frz357.4\pos(883.2,510.8)}FEDRA警告{\fs64}\N生物污染区域\N请勿继续前进
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.08,1:19:30.56,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,片尾曲：Depeche Mode《Never Let Me Down Again》，发表于1987年
